    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "s1_side02_fieldwork_sazare_pokehint_11",
      "hash64": "28337255EE03C60A",
      "text": "¡La composición te ha quedado niquelada!\\nA este paso me vas a superar, soci[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa...\\c\\nPor cierto, ¿has inspeccionado ya la laguna\\nque hay en la zona noroeste?[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
